      "title": "Xbox is testing pay-as-you-go cloud gaming without Game Pass",
      "tags": [
        "Xbox"
      ],
      "body": "It's called Cloud Playtime, and Xbox Insiders can try it now. Packs of hours are 10 hours for $3.99, 25 for $7.99 and 50 for $11.99. They're ad-free, unused hours don't expire, and there's also a free option with ads. The wider launch is due in November.",
